  "solution": {
    "text": "From conservation of energy<br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math>... (1)<br /><br />[can also be found by applying Bernouilli's theorem between 1 and 2]<br /><br />From continuity equation<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> (2)<br /><br />Substituting value of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> from Eq. (2) in Eq. (1)<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math><br /><br />or <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext> </mtext><msub> <mi>A</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mn>A</mn> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msub> <mn>v</mn> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mrow> <msubsup> <mn>v</mn> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </msubsup> <mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0034_e09ce48a3a76.jpg\" /><br /><br />Substituting the given values<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn> &nbsp;<mrow> <msup> <mtext>m/s</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.15 m</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5.0</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
